WEBVTT

00:13:28.474 --> 00:13:31.634
koja je oživljena svakom decenijom:

00:13:31.634 --> 00:13:33.648
autonomno vozilo.

00:13:33.648 --> 00:13:35.386
Sad mislite, ma daj.

00:13:35.386 --> 00:13:38.904
Kako savremena verzija tempomata

00:13:38.904 --> 00:13:40.604
može da bude značajna?

00:13:40.604 --> 00:13:42.728
Većina sveta

00:13:42.728 --> 00:13:46.211
je bila stvarana
oko puteva i prevoza.

00:13:46.211 --> 00:13:48.086
Oni su bili jednako bitni za uspeh

00:13:48.086 --> 00:13:49.584
Rimskog carstva

00:13:49.584 --> 00:13:51.569
kao sistem autoputeva unutar države

00:13:51.569 --> 00:13:53.363
za prosperitet i razvoj

00:13:53.363 --> 00:13:55.573
SAD-a.

00:13:55.573 --> 00:13:58.607
Danas, ovim putevima
koji povezuju naš svet

00:13:58.607 --> 00:14:00.705
dominiraju automobili i kamioni